      "text": "Phnom Penh is a busy city, and there are many ways to get around. A tuk-tuk is cheaper than a taxi, but it is slower and hotter in the dry season. Most people prefer motorbikes because they are the fastest way through the traffic. The new city buses are the most comfortable, and they are not as expensive as you might think. Walking is the healthiest way to travel, but it is not always the safest."
